{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这次，他对亲近的渴望显得格外舒展，欢喜里有了踏实的自信。因为他刚尝到自己的心意本身值得珍惜，喜欢这件事也有了独立的分量。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始更坦然地承认自己的喜欢，并让这份心意充分展开。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这一解释直接承接上一段对自身心意价值的确认，说明熟悉的亲近为何这次显得更自由、更有力量。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选2\",\n        \"候选3\",\n        \"候选14\",\n        \"候选15\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这次亲近带来的欢喜强烈得让他感到脆弱，越是投入，越能感到自己的心容易受伤。因为他已开始在意对方是否也愿走近，自己的感情便越来越牵动于对方的回应。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始感到，自己越认真地靠近，就越容易受对方回应牵动。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"这一解释把强烈感受理解为在意回应之后的脆弱感，能衔接此前的迟疑，也符合这段幸福深切却近乎难以承受的听感。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选8\",\n        \"候选11\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b48ec132-3d57-4e5d-8026-97782c09be1c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T023444898672Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.125, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:36:10.035181+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "82b7aefd2312ceb1c029d0be5c7e4cd775dbaec6a608ad81bf67f9121c82898b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browse